        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository defc9d36-a84d-46b9-be2c-f3a435287e96).Image",
        "Description": "Our client, Etta Davis, is a nurse who has asked us to take care of Ms. Crane, Mr. Yazdani, and Ms. Beaulieu who have taken a rare and endangered flower for their exhibition, which our client says can result in death if not properly used, so she has requested that we create a deterrent for those who wish to steal this flower from her. Also, we have been asked to eliminate another contestant, Mr. Takeuchi, who has been rude to another client due &quot;poor photography skills&quot;. Good Hunting, 47.",
